# Forecasts

- single: [forecast("Oaxaca", 2026-11-20)] 25°C / 14°C · sunny [forecast("Oaxaca", 2026-11-20, F)] 77°F / 57°F · sunny [forecast("Oaxaca", 2026-11-20, "CELSIUS")] 25°C / 14°C · sunny [forecast("Oaxaca", 2026-11-20, "FAHRENHEIT")] 77°F / 57°F · sunny
- single arity: [forecast("Oaxaca")] [forecast("Oaxaca", 2026-11-20, F, C)]
- single types: [forecast(1, 2026-11-20)] [forecast("Oaxaca", "soon")] [forecast("Oaxaca", 2026-11-20, K)] [forecast("Oaxaca", 2026-11-20, 3)]
