### 2 cli render tail.x.md --format text
$ xmd render tail.x.md --format text --root <root> --now 2026-09-16T14:00:00-04:00
exit 1
--- stdout
# The one-argument tail

## Chores :chores ████░░░░ 1/2 complete

- [x] Sweep
- [ ] Mop

- clock: [today(1)] [now(1)] [today(1, 2)] [now(1, 2)] [today(chores)] [now(chores)]
- plans: [maximize(1)] [minimize(1, 2)] [solve(1)] [maximize(chores)] [minimize(chores)] [solve(chores)]
- checklists: [total(chores)] 2 [completed(chores)] 1 [effort(chores)] 0s [total(chores, chores)] [completed(1)]
- dates: [date("2026-09-20")] 2026-09-20 [date("tomorrow")] 2026-09-17 [date("whenever")] [date(now())] 2026-09-16 [date(3)] [date()]
- eval: [import("probe").pair()]
